  "question": {
    "text": "If <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mo>:</mo><mi>R</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><mi>R</mi></math> is a function defined by <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mi>cos</mi><mfenced><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mfenced><mi>&#960;</mi><mo>,</mo></math>&nbsp;where <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\"><mo>&#183;</mo></mfenced></math> denotes the greatest integer function, then <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi></math> is:"
  },
